
---

## **7. ARQUIVOS DE CONFIGURAÇÃO ADICIONAIS**

### **`.gitignore`**
```gitignore
# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
.terraform.lock.hcl

# Kubernetes
kubeconfig
*.kubeconfig

# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Secrets
secrets.auto.tfvars
*.pem
*.key
*.crt

# Local scripts
scripts/.env
# --- Terraform (NEVER commit state/cache) ---
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.backup
!**/.terraform.lock.hcl

# --- Local tfvars (commit only *.example) ---
**/terraform.tfvars
!**/terraform.tfvars.example

# --- Backups / temp ---
*.bak
*.tmp
*.log
*~

